# Presigned document downloads (EOB / petty-cash receipts).
# Requires DNS A/AAAA for files.hisgc.co.tz → this VPS (Cloudflare DNS-only /
# grey-cloud). Proxied orange-cloud breaks ACME (521) until origin is reachable.
